Content in this directory
==========================

The HTML files in this directory are derived from DITA specification
source content published by the OASIS DITA Technical Committee
(https://github.com/oasis-tcs/dita), converted from XML to HTML
(and in places annotated) for use on this website.

No single dated copyright notice is attached to this source, as it is
drawn from the Technical Committee's working repository rather than a
finalized, published OASIS Standard or Committee Specification. If
OASIS later publishes a finalized DITA 2.0 deliverable carrying its
own dated copyright notice, that notice should be used instead of this
file for any content taken from the finalized version.

(The exact upstream commit each republish of this directory was
generated from is recorded in this repository's own commit history,
not in this file, so that this notice does not need to change every
time the content is resynced.)

Copyright © OASIS Open. All Rights Reserved.

